  "description": "ROHWAP crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H68 F6 Gd4 N10 O20 P2 2+,2(C1 H4 O1),2(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.081-4.249 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 111.71-117.90°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C58H74Cl2F6Gd4N10O24P2.",
